
/****************************************************************
 * Program name: backward_compatibility_to_v1.2.sas
 * Written by: Brad McDowell, University of Iowa
 *
 * This script renames all elements that are in common across
 * Version 1.2 and Version 2025 of the PCORnet Tumor Table to
 * match Version 1.2. This will allow programs written for 
 * Version 1.2 to run on the Version 2025 table.
 *
 * This is designed to be called from another SAS program. It
 * is assumed that program will have a macro variable "version".
 * This will rename the variables if &version = tumor_v2025.
 *
 ****************************************************************/

